WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.374
- Alright, what entertainment

00:00:01.374 --> 00:00:03.524
do you have for me today, internet?

00:00:03.524 --> 00:00:05.288
Cat photo, cat photo.

00:00:05.288 --> 00:00:07.889
Rant about people responding
to a tragedy incorrectly.

00:00:07.889 --> 00:00:08.929
Cat photo.

00:00:08.929 --> 00:00:09.695
(gasps)

00:00:09.695 --> 00:00:12.499
Jerry T. Lewins said Star
Battles is the worst franchise

00:00:12.499 --> 00:00:15.537
of all time, anyone who
watches it is a moron?

00:00:15.537 --> 00:00:17.209
No, I will not engage.

00:00:17.209 --> 00:00:18.852
No matter how wrong he is.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:22.196
He said Princess Corenza is
a sad excuse for a character

00:00:22.196 --> 00:00:24.262
and belongs in the kitchen?

00:00:24.262 --> 00:00:25.609
Deep breath.

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:27.490
Instead of responding, I
can go get a cup of tea

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:28.976
and calm my nerves.

00:00:28.976 --> 00:00:30.345
(whoosh)

00:00:30.345 --> 00:00:31.669
(squeaking)

00:00:31.669 --> 00:00:35.124
(calming music)

00:00:35.124 --> 00:00:36.076
(upbeat electronic music)

00:00:36.076 --> 00:00:37.725
Lukins is the worst director of all time!

00:00:37.725 --> 00:00:39.164
Are you kidding me?

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:40.580
OK, OK.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.556
Calm down.

00:00:41.556 --> 00:00:43.439
Maybe it's time for a little walk.

00:00:43.439 --> 00:00:45.021
(calming music)

00:00:45.021 --> 00:00:46.298
He said what?

00:00:46.298 --> 00:00:48.352
You know what, I'll
finally finish my novel.

00:00:48.352 --> 00:00:49.877
(intense electronic music)

00:00:49.877 --> 00:00:53.727
(calming music)

00:00:53.727 --> 00:00:55.422
(beep)

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:56.350
No.

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.830
I'll take up crocheting,
like I've always wanted to.

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:03.265
(calming music, followed by intense music)

00:01:03.265 --> 00:01:06.748
I'll adopt a baby, and raise
her in a good household

00:01:06.748 --> 00:01:10.230
until she's 18 and I send
her off to a great college.

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:13.579
(calming music)

00:01:15.479 --> 00:01:17.076
(beep)

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:18.088
Goddamit!

00:01:18.088 --> 00:01:20.293
I'll train for the
astronaut program at NASA.

00:01:20.293 --> 00:01:23.265
Get accepted, fly to Mars,
start a colony up there.

00:01:23.265 --> 00:01:26.354
Wow, this place is beautiful.

00:01:26.354 --> 00:01:29.106
Almost forgot why I came
up here to begin with.

00:01:30.872 --> 00:01:32.311
Wow, I get service up here, too.

00:01:32.311 --> 00:01:33.373
(beep)

00:01:33.867 --> 00:01:34.517
Ah.

00:01:34.517 --> 00:01:35.525
(bleep)

00:01:35.525 --> 00:01:37.702
(intense electronic music)

00:01:37.702 --> 00:01:40.442
You, Mr. Jerry T. Lewins,
are an incredible idiot.

00:01:40.442 --> 00:01:42.787
Not only did Star Battles
inspire a generation,

00:01:42.787 --> 00:01:44.599
Princess Corenza was the
first female character

00:01:44.599 --> 00:01:47.478
in history to ever kill a man
with her bare hands on film,

00:01:47.478 --> 00:01:49.660
so she is more progressive
and creative than anything

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:53.213
you could imagine, you thoughtless swine.

00:01:54.263 --> 00:01:57.861
(beeping)

00:01:57.861 --> 00:02:00.456
I immediately regret this.

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:05.216
(intense electronic music)

00:02:06.568 --> 00:02:07.659
(whoosh)

00:02:07.659 --> 00:02:08.931
(squeaking)

